# Heimdall Configuration

## Windows Defender Settings

# Path to Windows Defender command-line tool
# Default: C:\Program Files\Windows Defender\MpCmdRun.exe
DEFENDER_PATH=C:\Program Files\Windows Defender\MpCmdRun.exe

# Scan timeout settings (in seconds)
FILE_SCAN_TIMEOUT=300
DIRECTORY_SCAN_TIMEOUT=600
QUICK_SCAN_TIMEOUT=600
SIGNATURE_UPDATE_TIMEOUT=300

# Logging
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
